(1136281, 140878, 29269, '<td valign="top">Probably not the ribbon winner, but great idea and very appropriate image.<br/>a neater (flat, solid color) background might have worked better. This way it attracts too much attention.</td>', 'Probably not the ribbon winner, but great idea and very appropriate image.a neater (flat, solid color) background might have worked better. This way it attracts too much attention.', '2005-01-28 00:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
