(1136890, 140624, 7263, '<td valign="top">Should be more careful with your footprints..easier to say than do I know.<br/> <br/>I think the 3 stumps isn''t obvious enough for the average voter perhaps.<br/></td>', 'Should be more careful with your footprints..easier to say than do I know. I think the 3 stumps isn''t obvious enough for the average voter perhaps.', '2005-01-28 11:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
