(1136923, 140853, 7263, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot but I think in landscape it would be more effective as the black void at the top doesn''t do much for the image - just leaves it looking like something is supposed to be there.<br/> <br/>Meets challenge too :D *<br/></td>', 'Not a bad shot but I think in landscape it would be more effective as the black void at the top doesn''t do much for the image - just leaves it looking like something is supposed to be there. Meets challenge too :D *', '2005-01-28 11:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136940, 140303, 21367, '<td valign="top">Three disticnt sides of the canister, Title does not coach the viewer in the direction of 3.  I like it, but you are going to get hammered for this one.  This is a thinking person''s piece.  Don''t take it to heart because technically this is a very good shot.  The only thing I might have done is to crop a tad bit more from the right, thinking (in thirds rule) 2/3''s canister and remaining 1/3 negative space.  Leaving the tight crop on the left.</td>', 'Three disticnt sides of the canister, Title does not coach the viewer in the direction of 3.  I like it, but you are going to get hammered for this one.  This is a thinking person''s piece.  Don''t take it to heart because technically this is a very good shot.  The only thing I might have done is to crop a tad bit more from the right, thinking (in thirds rule) 2/3''s canister and remaining 1/3 negative space.  Leaving the tight crop on the left.', '2005-01-28 11:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136950, 140579, 24911, '<td valign="top">Too soft IMHO. As if there is no focus.</td>', 'Too soft IMHO. As if there is no focus.', '2005-01-28 11:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136954, 140354, 24911, '<td valign="top">There isn''t really three parts. Maybe two.<br/>And the middle part there is a road that cut it to half two.</td>', 'There isn''t really three parts. Maybe two.And the middle part there is a road that cut it to half two.', '2005-01-28 11:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136982, 140837, 24976, '<td valign="top">the photo does not seem to be fully finished in the sense of it being ''polished'' by post processing.</td>', 'the photo does not seem to be fully finished in the sense of it being ''polished'' by post processing.', '2005-01-28 12:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136984, 140876, 24976, '<td valign="top">I like the rusty texture, one of the first things i noticed was that the center light isnt as sharp as the other two. Maybe a selective unsharp mask could fix that.</td>', 'I like the rusty texture, one of the first things i noticed was that the center light isnt as sharp as the other two. Maybe a selective unsharp mask could fix that.', '2005-01-28 12:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136986, 140806, 24976, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Its really becoming a cliche to have flowers and drops of water here on dpc but a good photo will always be a good photo regardless of the subject. well done</td>', 'Lovely. Its really becoming a cliche to have flowers and drops of water here on dpc but a good photo will always be a good photo regardless of the subject. well done', '2005-01-28 12:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136992, 140831, 24976, '<td valign="top">multiple exposure? Creatively done... I would have added a bit more white highlights with the dodge tool.</td>', 'multiple exposure? Creatively done... I would have added a bit more white highlights with the dodge tool.', '2005-01-28 12:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136995, 140827, 24976, '<td valign="top">Imo the colors of the image arent working well (or maybe its just my personal tastes) maybe this would have looked better in b/w?</td>', 'Imo the colors of the image arent working well (or maybe its just my personal tastes) maybe this would have looked better in b/w?', '2005-01-28 12:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137001, 140272, 24976, '<td valign="top">very calming, relaxing image. I like the softness and gentle edges of all the objects. Maybe this would have looked better with the table less slanting, but thats just a maybe.</td>', 'very calming, relaxing image. I like the softness and gentle edges of all the objects. Maybe this would have looked better with the table less slanting, but thats just a maybe.', '2005-01-28 12:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
