(1137019, 140820, 24976, '<td valign="top">seems slightly out of focus. Im curious as to what the color version looked like. Usually with interesting texture and this sort of ''grudge'' style they have very interesting colors. Also its an advanced editing rules so you could have added you own colors in ps.</td>', 'seems slightly out of focus. Im curious as to what the color version looked like. Usually with interesting texture and this sort of ''grudge'' style they have very interesting colors. Also its an advanced editing rules so you could have added you own colors in ps.', '2005-01-28 12:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
