(1137147, 140052, 31133, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this without the big house in the background - or maybe with the house blurred ini the background so the tree could stand out. The color of the house is so similar to the tree, that I think maybe the viewer''s focus is distracted away from what you might hope.</td>', 'I''d like to see this without the big house in the background - or maybe with the house blurred ini the background so the tree could stand out. The color of the house is so similar to the tree, that I think maybe the viewer''s focus is distracted away from what you might hope.', '2005-01-28 13:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1137150, 140763, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice work!<br/>Edit after the challenge: Sorry I hurried too fast with my comments here.<br/>I like the focus here - sharp bird''s feet and sand, with the soft foreground and a blurred background. I also really liked the colors, and especially of the orange beaks. However, now that I''ve seen stdavidsson''s take on this shot, something between his level of brightness / color and your original variant would''ve been great.<br/> <br/>If I stare at this long enough, I can find only one thing I''d like better about this: It would be nice if the bird on the left had its entire tail in the shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-04 13:55:20.</i></td>', 'Nice work!Edit after the challenge: Sorry I hurried too fast with my comments here.I like the focus here - sharp bird''s feet and sand, with the soft foreground and a blurred background. I also really liked the colors, and especially of the orange beaks. However, now that I''ve seen stdavidsson''s take on this shot, something between his level of brightness / color and your original variant would''ve been great. If I stare at this long enough, I can find only one thing I''d like better about this: It would be nice if the bird on the left had its entire tail in the shot.', '2005-01-28 13:50:52.000000', '2005-02-04 13:55:20.000000', 1),
(1137153, 140484, 31133, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot; the soft orangey-pink is very nice, as is the feeling of isoloation of the islands.</td>', 'I like this one a lot; the soft orangey-pink is very nice, as is the feeling of isoloation of the islands.', '2005-01-28 13:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
