(1138249, 140797, 9906, '<td valign="top">Too high key.  You lose too much detail.  Great composition, just overexposed.<br/>TC</td>', 'Too high key.  You lose too much detail.  Great composition, just overexposed.TC', '2005-01-29 02:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138251, 140579, 9906, '<td valign="top">IMHO, Your DOF is too shallow.  (It almost looks like it was PS''ed in)  The lines on the paper are distracting and don''t add to the composition.  Your leading lines are not bad, but lose some impact with the lack of focus.<br/>TC</td>', 'IMHO, Your DOF is too shallow.  (It almost looks like it was PS''ed in)  The lines on the paper are distracting and don''t add to the composition.  Your leading lines are not bad, but lose some impact with the lack of focus.TC', '2005-01-29 02:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
