(1138253, 140562, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  Your focus is spot on, great textures in the petals.  Wonderful lighting.  Great colors without being oversaturated.  Nice composition.  Only complaint is that the white border kinda competes with the subject.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nicely done!  Your focus is spot on, great textures in the petals.  Wonderful lighting.  Great colors without being oversaturated.  Nice composition.  Only complaint is that the white border kinda competes with the subject.TC', '2005-01-29 02:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138254, 140336, 9906, '<td valign="top">I can here it now from the younger generation...  What the hell is it supposed to be!  Sometimes I miss the low tech days...<br/>TC</td>', 'I can here it now from the younger generation...  What the hell is it supposed to be!  Sometimes I miss the low tech days...TC', '2005-01-29 02:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138256, 140836, 9906, '<td valign="top">That''s a stroll!  Body language doesn''t match being on march...  At least not in my memory of boot camp days...  Too much going on in the background takes away from the main subject of the shot.  Like the road, just too much unnecessary stuff to the right of the three.<br/>TC</td>', 'That''s a stroll!  Body language doesn''t match being on march...  At least not in my memory of boot camp days...  Too much going on in the background takes away from the main subject of the shot.  Like the road, just too much unnecessary stuff to the right of the three.TC', '2005-01-29 02:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138257, 140623, 9906, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but nothing really there to hold interest...<br/>TC</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but nothing really there to hold interest...TC', '2005-01-29 02:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138265, 140603, 9906, '<td valign="top">Not a bad composition, but...  You used the flash on the camera didn''t you...  You would be much better off putting the camera on tripod (best) or another secure solid surface and using existing light.  This is very flat and harsly lit.  The depth is all washed out by the proximity of the flash with the lens...<br/>TC</td>', 'Not a bad composition, but...  You used the flash on the camera didn''t you...  You would be much better off putting the camera on tripod (best) or another secure solid surface and using existing light.  This is very flat and harsly lit.  The depth is all washed out by the proximity of the flash with the lens...TC', '2005-01-29 02:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
