(1138593, 140405, 29255, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is very nice. Bottom of image area is a bit dull, but the action area is just great. Contrary to many other images this image is much better bigger than as a thumbnail. Caustic reflections add to the image!</td>', 'Oh, this is very nice. Bottom of image area is a bit dull, but the action area is just great. Contrary to many other images this image is much better bigger than as a thumbnail. Caustic reflections add to the image!', '2005-01-29 11:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138595, 140784, 29255, '<td valign="top">The animal is very soft whereas the rest is quite sharp. The borders feel very curvy, maybe due the light. I''m sure some work on the composition would have enhanced the idea.</td>', 'The animal is very soft whereas the rest is quite sharp. The borders feel very curvy, maybe due the light. I''m sure some work on the composition would have enhanced the idea.', '2005-01-29 11:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138597, 140541, 29404, '<td valign="top">woow...is that u sitting on the ice there?.....man u freezed ur back there.....nice shot in a creative but painfull mode....very welldone<br/>REGARDS<br/>//www.photo.net/photodb/user?user_id=1185903</td>', 'woow...is that u sitting on the ice there?.....man u freezed ur back there.....nice shot in a creative but painfull mode....very welldoneREGARDS//www.photo.net/photodb/user?user_id=1185903', '2005-01-29 11:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138599, 140586, 29255, '<td valign="top">This is golden light for golden watches, but the tones don''t shine at all, they''re very restricted. The leftmost feels like it''s dropping out of image, due to it''s position, size and twisted form. Besides, it''s just getting to the three.</td>', 'This is golden light for golden watches, but the tones don''t shine at all, they''re very restricted. The leftmost feels like it''s dropping out of image, due to it''s position, size and twisted form. Besides, it''s just getting to the three.', '2005-01-29 11:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138602, 140543, 29404, '<td valign="top">i like the composition of that shot alot...very nice effects with the shallow DOP.<br/> <br/>REGARDS<br/>//www.photo.net/photodb/user?user_id=1185903</td>', 'i like the composition of that shot alot...very nice effects with the shallow DOP. REGARDS//www.photo.net/photodb/user?user_id=1185903', '2005-01-29 11:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138603, 140763, 29255, '<td valign="top">Unless the light of the day was extremely dull, the image feels quite underexposed and really needs some work on the tones. I don''t get feeling the two are watching what the third does, so it''s quite asymmetric, like composed of two separate happenings. But there''s potential on the idea, so maybe with retakes you''re able to make it better.</td>', 'Unless the light of the day was extremely dull, the image feels quite underexposed and really needs some work on the tones. I don''t get feeling the two are watching what the third does, so it''s quite asymmetric, like composed of two separate happenings. But there''s potential on the idea, so maybe with retakes you''re able to make it better.', '2005-01-29 11:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138605, 140885, 29255, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it almost at all. Three shiny objects on black background, underexposed not to burn the shiny parts too heavily. Composition doesn''t add up to much. I''m sure there''s some idea behind here, but I''m not getting it.</td>', 'I don''t get it almost at all. Three shiny objects on black background, underexposed not to burn the shiny parts too heavily. Composition doesn''t add up to much. I''m sure there''s some idea behind here, but I''m not getting it.', '2005-01-29 11:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138607, 140894, 29404, '<td valign="top">love the composition and the color..very welldone in a romantic mode.<br/>REGARDS<br/>//www.photo.net/photodb/user?user_id=1185903</td>', 'love the composition and the color..very welldone in a romantic mode.REGARDS//www.photo.net/photodb/user?user_id=1185903', '2005-01-29 11:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138608, 140562, 29404, '<td valign="top">great shot,...wonderfull colors....and very good sharpness<br/>regards<br/>//www.photo.net/photodb/user?user_id=1185903</td>', 'great shot,...wonderfull colors....and very good sharpnessregards//www.photo.net/photodb/user?user_id=1185903', '2005-01-29 11:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138611, 140579, 29255, '<td valign="top">Marvellous use of depth of field. Feels like it would have worked better if there''d be less of artificial feeling in the effect. The major colors of the pens don''t have much tones left, but the tips and the wood is great. I''m sure you''d have got more out of the background lines by testing various positions. I''m not sure there''s point to get lost of the lines on top right corner. Also I''m not sure the light yellows on same area add up.</td>', 'Marvellous use of depth of field. Feels like it would have worked better if there''d be less of artificial feeling in the effect. The major colors of the pens don''t have much tones left, but the tips and the wood is great. I''m sure you''d have got more out of the background lines by testing various positions. I''m not sure there''s point to get lost of the lines on top right corner. Also I''m not sure the light yellows on same area add up.', '2005-01-29 11:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138612, 140884, 29404, '<td valign="top">nice composition and colors..and the transformation from white to red realy works here cuase the size of the middell one is biger than the other 2 which makes the impact of the transformation.<br/>regards<br/>//www.photo.net/photodb/user?user_id=1185903</td>', 'nice composition and colors..and the transformation from white to red realy works here cuase the size of the middell one is biger than the other 2 which makes the impact of the transformation.regards//www.photo.net/photodb/user?user_id=1185903', '2005-01-29 11:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138613, 140806, 29255, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones and feeling. I don''t get many hints why is the situation like it is. So maybe there''s some need to get more of the tale in the image.</td>', 'Very nice tones and feeling. I don''t get many hints why is the situation like it is. So maybe there''s some need to get more of the tale in the image.', '2005-01-29 11:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138614, 140577, 29404, '<td valign="top">nice ...nice ...nice<br/>that is why i love the snow<br/>regards<br/>//www.photo.net/photodb/user?user_id=1185903</td>', 'nice ...nice ...nicethat is why i love the snowregards//www.photo.net/photodb/user?user_id=1185903', '2005-01-29 11:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138616, 140077, 29255, '<td valign="top">Or 21? I woud not have guessed right without the name. Very nice work to get the local contrast work on the numbers. The photo has been composed in a good manner too, even the repeating pattern on bottom right corner.</td>', 'Or 21? I woud not have guessed right without the name. Very nice work to get the local contrast work on the numbers. The photo has been composed in a good manner too, even the repeating pattern on bottom right corner.', '2005-01-29 11:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138619, 140798, 29255, '<td valign="top">There''s definitely some triangles here. But what''s the reason for the thin "light-rays" from the top to the bottom like what one can see on sky when sun shines through the broken clouds. Composition is surprisingly stabile compared to the position of main triangle, the sharp end of shadown and the unstable position of the triangle.</td>', 'There''s definitely some triangles here. But what''s the reason for the thin "light-rays" from the top to the bottom like what one can see on sky when sun shines through the broken clouds. Composition is surprisingly stabile compared to the position of main triangle, the sharp end of shadown and the unstable position of the triangle.', '2005-01-29 11:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138621, 140893, 29255, '<td valign="top">I have absolutely no idea what these are, but I''m surprised how well does the harsh light work here. I don''t like seemingly burned areas, but the compostion is very intriguing if maybe a bit too unbalanced.</td>', 'I have absolutely no idea what these are, but I''m surprised how well does the harsh light work here. I don''t like seemingly burned areas, but the compostion is very intriguing if maybe a bit too unbalanced.', '2005-01-29 11:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138623, 140582, 29255, '<td valign="top">We''re tilting here, or at least the feeling is so. Image is simple in a good way, if maybe a bit uninteresting. Also the general feeling is quite gray.</td>', 'We''re tilting here, or at least the feeling is so. Image is simple in a good way, if maybe a bit uninteresting. Also the general feeling is quite gray.', '2005-01-29 11:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138624, 140262, 29255, '<td valign="top">The burned whites on background and clothes don''t suit the image. Some flesh tones are a bit odd, like reds on left most girl. Also the masking has been a bit too sharp, so there''s uneasy feeling for me.</td>', 'The burned whites on background and clothes don''t suit the image. Some flesh tones are a bit odd, like reds on left most girl. Also the masking has been a bit too sharp, so there''s uneasy feeling for me.', '2005-01-29 11:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138625, 140827, 29255, '<td valign="top">Harsh light works surprisingly well. Usually these kind of images would be trashed by the flash. The ring doesn''t fit with it''s high contrast and almost out of image position. Background, on the contrary, is marvellous!</td>', 'Harsh light works surprisingly well. Usually these kind of images would be trashed by the flash. The ring doesn''t fit with it''s high contrast and almost out of image position. Background, on the contrary, is marvellous!', '2005-01-29 11:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138628, 140549, 29255, '<td valign="top">This is extremely nice. Composition works, and the idea is great. If only the bottommost spike wouldn''t shine that much nor the leave glow that much on the bottom part (the top part is great)!</td>', 'This is extremely nice. Composition works, and the idea is great. If only the bottommost spike wouldn''t shine that much nor the leave glow that much on the bottom part (the top part is great)!', '2005-01-29 11:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138629, 140665, 29255, '<td valign="top">Almost feels like these are animals on their own :).</td>', 'Almost feels like these are animals on their own :).', '2005-01-29 11:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138631, 140541, 29255, '<td valign="top">The guy and the chair are marvellous and perfect for a subject on their own, but the background doesn''t add up meaningfully. The other people are quite a bit of stretch so the image doesn''t fit too well on this theme. I''d like to give you much higher number, but can''t in this category. And you''ll make the image better by reconsidering the tones on the ice (and border).</td>', 'The guy and the chair are marvellous and perfect for a subject on their own, but the background doesn''t add up meaningfully. The other people are quite a bit of stretch so the image doesn''t fit too well on this theme. I''d like to give you much higher number, but can''t in this category. And you''ll make the image better by reconsidering the tones on the ice (and border).', '2005-01-29 11:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138632, 140320, 29255, '<td valign="top">Depth of field is blurring and separating the third one. Colors are quite saturated, feel like oversaturated, but exposure has been nice on the background.</td>', 'Depth of field is blurring and separating the third one. Colors are quite saturated, feel like oversaturated, but exposure has been nice on the background.', '2005-01-29 11:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138634, 140052, 29255, '<td valign="top">This is perhaps the worst image on the challenge. The light is awful and it has pushed the tones very unsatisfying. The only good color contrast shines in cut branch and that makes me wonder what exactly are the three branches as the trees are full of branches and there''s even more branches on the background. The house on the background is falling backwards. The composition doesn''t really highlight what''s the photographers point here. I''m sure you had good intentions, but I''d say there''s lot of potential for you to develop your senses by retaking this image. Choose better lighting, experiment with dozens of different compositions and arrangements with this exactly same subject, work on the image when it''s on the computer by chaning it levels, diminishing the unneeded background etc. Then compare to this take, and I''m sure you''ll get some "hmm...Hmmm..." -moments!</td>', 'This is perhaps the worst image on the challenge. The light is awful and it has pushed the tones very unsatisfying. The only good color contrast shines in cut branch and that makes me wonder what exactly are the three branches as the trees are full of branches and there''s even more branches on the background. The house on the background is falling backwards. The composition doesn''t really highlight what''s the photographers point here. I''m sure you had good intentions, but I''d say there''s lot of potential for you to develop your senses by retaking this image. Choose better lighting, experiment with dozens of different compositions and arrangements with this exactly same subject, work on the image when it''s on the computer by chaning it levels, diminishing the unneeded background etc. Then compare to this take, and I''m sure you''ll get some "hmm...Hmmm..." -moments!', '2005-01-29 11:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138636, 140781, 29255, '<td valign="top">My girlfriend liked the idea, the simplicity but I hate the tones and don''t get almost anything at all from the image.</td>', 'My girlfriend liked the idea, the simplicity but I hate the tones and don''t get almost anything at all from the image.', '2005-01-29 11:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138637, 140889, 8005, '<td valign="top">A little out of focus</td>', 'A little out of focus', '2005-01-29 11:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138638, 140797, 29255, '<td valign="top">Nice use of effect! One head is a bit overlapping, but works quite well overall!</td>', 'Nice use of effect! One head is a bit overlapping, but works quite well overall!', '2005-01-29 11:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138639, 140635, 8005, '<td valign="top">Very nice close up. Good focus.</td>', 'Very nice close up. Good focus.', '2005-01-29 11:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138641, 140355, 29255, '<td valign="top">Quite original idea, but feels like it could be reworked to maintain even a bit of sharpness.</td>', 'Quite original idea, but feels like it could be reworked to maintain even a bit of sharpness.', '2005-01-29 11:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138644, 140801, 29255, '<td valign="top">Perhaps this is a cultural thing, because I don''t have any idea what you''ve survived. But good for you! Image has quite warm feeling, but I''d like the white closer to the white.</td>', 'Perhaps this is a cultural thing, because I don''t have any idea what you''ve survived. But good for you! Image has quite warm feeling, but I''d like the white closer to the white.', '2005-01-29 11:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138645, 140848, 29255, '<td valign="top">The light on right and left bottles are very nice, but third one feels out of place.</td>', 'The light on right and left bottles are very nice, but third one feels out of place.', '2005-01-29 11:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138649, 140274, 29255, '<td valign="top">Completely unsharp. Nice idea, but needs better execution!</td>', 'Completely unsharp. Nice idea, but needs better execution!', '2005-01-29 11:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138652, 140623, 29255, '<td valign="top">Give some room for the highest pole. Very nice tones.</td>', 'Give some room for the highest pole. Very nice tones.', '2005-01-29 11:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138657, 140884, 5286, '<td valign="top">Very cleanly done.</td>', 'Very cleanly done.', '2005-01-29 11:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138661, 140803, 5286, '<td valign="top">It''s well composed, but I wish the focus were sharper on the bird in front...</td>', 'It''s well composed, but I wish the focus were sharper on the bird in front...', '2005-01-29 11:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138666, 140843, 5286, '<td valign="top">This is very neat. I''d certainly like to know how you got those refractions so neatly in the balls. Nice color on the balls, though I''m not sure the grey background goes too well with it.</td>', 'This is very neat. I''d certainly like to know how you got those refractions so neatly in the balls. Nice color on the balls, though I''m not sure the grey background goes too well with it.', '2005-01-29 11:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138667, 140596, 5286, '<td valign="top">Indeed. Never. Don''t you do it again!! :D</td>', 'Indeed. Never. Don''t you do it again!! :D', '2005-01-29 11:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138671, 140225, 5286, '<td valign="top">IMO there are too many things here, something a little more minimal withteh same three colors might have worked better.</td>', 'IMO there are too many things here, something a little more minimal withteh same three colors might have worked better.', '2005-01-29 11:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138673, 140677, 5286, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2005-01-29 11:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138676, 140571, 5286, '<td valign="top">That''s 6 :).. Serious.u, though, the top of the front glass getting cropped off isn''t that fun. Also the lighting is a little flat for all the details in the glass. And the three at the back are really very distracting, since their angle is not harmonious at all, and they are out of focus, etc etc. Basically they are unnecessary, and being Advanced Editing, it could be cloned out.</td>', 'That''s 6 :).. Serious.u, though, the top of the front glass getting cropped off isn''t that fun. Also the lighting is a little flat for all the details in the glass. And the three at the back are really very distracting, since their angle is not harmonious at all, and they are out of focus, etc etc. Basically they are unnecessary, and being Advanced Editing, it could be cloned out.', '2005-01-29 12:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138677, 140877, 5286, '<td valign="top">Is this actually  for Road SIgns too :D? Funny :)</td>', 'Is this actually  for Road SIgns too :D? Funny :)', '2005-01-29 12:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138678, 140791, 5286, '<td valign="top">Lovely background!</td>', 'Lovely background!', '2005-01-29 12:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138681, 140654, 5286, '<td valign="top">Very cleanly done! I like the colors a lot too :)</td>', 'Very cleanly done! I like the colors a lot too :)', '2005-01-29 12:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138684, 140596, 32702, '<td valign="top">Brilliant picture... Good colours and contrast.</td>', 'Brilliant picture... Good colours and contrast.', '2005-01-29 12:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138688, 140603, 14476, '<td valign="top">cute idea, well composed.  maybe a little overexposed?</td>', 'cute idea, well composed.  maybe a little overexposed?', '2005-01-29 12:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138689, 140443, 14476, '<td valign="top">original.  great design.</td>', 'original.  great design.', '2005-01-29 12:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138690, 140753, 14476, '<td valign="top">great idea.  maybe a little more depth of field to get that last 3 in focus?  composition is super!</td>', 'great idea.  maybe a little more depth of field to get that last 3 in focus?  composition is super!', '2005-01-29 12:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138695, 140810, 14476, '<td valign="top">Super idea.  All those threes!  If it was mine, I''d probably move the whole composition up a touch, rather than rest it on the bottom border.  And maybe a touch more dof.  But you chose a different way and that''s okay too!</td>', 'Super idea.  All those threes!  If it was mine, I''d probably move the whole composition up a touch, rather than rest it on the bottom border.  And maybe a touch more dof.  But you chose a different way and that''s okay too!', '2005-01-29 12:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138696, 140525, 14476, '<td valign="top">I''ll take your word for the three content of this one.  :&gt;)<br/>Nicely photographed.</td>', 'I''ll take your word for the three content of this one.  :>)Nicely photographed.', '2005-01-29 12:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138697, 140320, 14476, '<td valign="top">Super idea!  Maybe a bit too high key?  Love the composition.</td>', 'Super idea!  Maybe a bit too high key?  Love the composition.', '2005-01-29 12:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138700, 140603, 5286, '<td valign="top">It''s awfully funny :)). The image quality is not great: I think there''s grain in the background that''s not intentional, which neatimage would fix very nicely, and the lighting is a little flattish. <br/>But just for the humor, I''ll give this a 9 :)</td>', 'It''s awfully funny :)). The image quality is not great: I think there''s grain in the background that''s not intentional, which neatimage would fix very nicely, and the lighting is a little flattish. But just for the humor, I''ll give this a 9 :)', '2005-01-29 12:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138701, 140569, 14476, '<td valign="top">Original.  I like the placement of the elements in the frame.  If it was mine, I''d probably vary the exposure times to see if the headlights could be a little more under control.  (assuming traffic would cooperate)</td>', 'Original.  I like the placement of the elements in the frame.  If it was mine, I''d probably vary the exposure times to see if the headlights could be a little more under control.  (assuming traffic would cooperate)', '2005-01-29 12:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138703, 140811, 14476, '<td valign="top">simple yet interesting.  I like your composition - even though it leads out of the frame.  There''s enough interest to pull the viewer back in.</td>', 'simple yet interesting.  I like your composition - even though it leads out of the frame.  There''s enough interest to pull the viewer back in.', '2005-01-29 12:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138704, 140812, 14476, '<td valign="top">Love your ''dudes''.  Expect your equipment is not up to your excellent talent for seeing wildlife and your good composition.</td>', 'Love your ''dudes''.  Expect your equipment is not up to your excellent talent for seeing wildlife and your good composition.', '2005-01-29 12:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138708, 140226, 5286, '<td valign="top">Like I said, it makes me laugh :))</td>', 'Like I said, it makes me laugh :))', '2005-01-29 12:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138713, 140676, 14476, '<td valign="top">Really cute idea.  And I like the reflective surface too.  It''s hard to do that without getting ''unwanted'' reflections as well!  Good one.</td>', 'Really cute idea.  And I like the reflective surface too.  It''s hard to do that without getting ''unwanted'' reflections as well!  Good one.', '2005-01-29 12:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138715, 140665, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good composition and good seeing.  Maybe your equipment got in the way of a really nice image...  Backlighting is tricky anyhow.</td>', 'Good composition and good seeing.  Maybe your equipment got in the way of a really nice image...  Backlighting is tricky anyhow.', '2005-01-29 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138718, 140898, 14476, '<td valign="top">I don ''t mark down for borders, but this one is a bit over-the-top.  Hard to look at the image with the strong border getting in  my way.  Of course, that''s just my opinion.    In any event,  your image is an original take on the challenge, and a very good abstract.</td>', 'I don ''t mark down for borders, but this one is a bit over-the-top.  Hard to look at the image with the strong border getting in  my way.  Of course, that''s just my opinion.    In any event,  your image is an original take on the challenge, and a very good abstract.', '2005-01-29 12:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138721, 140624, 14476, '<td valign="top">Lovely take on the challenge.  Great dof and composition.   Glad it was you out there and not me!</td>', 'Lovely take on the challenge.  Great dof and composition.   Glad it was you out there and not me!', '2005-01-29 12:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138722, 140336, 14476, '<td valign="top">How many of us recognize a striking typewriter key any more?  Very good and subtle capture.  Hope voters stop to look at this one and  it does well.</td>', 'How many of us recognize a striking typewriter key any more?  Very good and subtle capture.  Hope voters stop to look at this one and  it does well.', '2005-01-29 12:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138724, 140894, 14476, '<td valign="top">Super idea!   If it was mine, I''d probably cut out a bit of the undergrowth to give even more attention to the clover.  still, it meets the challenge beautifully.</td>', 'Super idea!   If it was mine, I''d probably cut out a bit of the undergrowth to give even more attention to the clover.  still, it meets the challenge beautifully.', '2005-01-29 12:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138726, 140543, 14476, '<td valign="top">Great idea;  super composition.  If it was mine, I''d probably really work for crisp DOF all the way through the image.</td>', 'Great idea;  super composition.  If it was mine, I''d probably really work for crisp DOF all the way through the image.', '2005-01-29 12:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138730, 140630, 20679, '<td valign="top">This is such a nice image but could have been a definite winner in my opinion if the crop took out most of the distracting spots in the snow in the lower third of the frame. Then the use of negative space would have been more powerful with the starkness of the black and white being accentuated. Just my opinion, but I am reaching for the crop tool as I look at this. I think it is one of the best shots in the challenge but could be killer!</td>', 'This is such a nice image but could have been a definite winner in my opinion if the crop took out most of the distracting spots in the snow in the lower third of the frame. Then the use of negative space would have been more powerful with the starkness of the black and white being accentuated. Just my opinion, but I am reaching for the crop tool as I look at this. I think it is one of the best shots in the challenge but could be killer!', '2005-01-29 12:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138732, 140549, 14476, '<td valign="top">Love it!   10</td>', 'Love it!   10', '2005-01-29 12:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138739, 140076, 20679, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I think this just lacks an enormous amount of creativity. The symmetry is not quite accurate enough, the verticals or not vertical and the lighting is flat.  Also the background is  rather dull. I hate being this critical, but the shot appears to be thrown together without any real thought, and those kind of shots don''t do well on here. Being different and original can sometimes overcome some technical shortcomings, but you have to have at least one of those elements to stand a chance of a decent score.</td>', 'Sorry but I think this just lacks an enormous amount of creativity. The symmetry is not quite accurate enough, the verticals or not vertical and the lighting is flat.  Also the background is  rather dull. I hate being this critical, but the shot appears to be thrown together without any real thought, and those kind of shots don''t do well on here. Being different and original can sometimes overcome some technical shortcomings, but you have to have at least one of those elements to stand a chance of a decent score.', '2005-01-29 12:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1138746, 140209, 20679, '<td valign="top">The highly saturated nature of this shot is dramatic. The composition is OK but not great and technically there are four trees and a rather disctracting pole. I''m afraid I also find the border rather heavy.  Score - 5  (four trees plus a pole!)</td>', 'The highly saturated nature of this shot is dramatic. The composition is OK but not great and technically there are four trees and a rather disctracting pole. I''m afraid I also find the border rather heavy.  Score - 5  (four trees plus a pole!)', '2005-01-29 12:57:47.000000', NULL, 1);
