(1139240, 140562, 30959, '<td valign="top">Flowers are like opium to me.. give me a camera and a botanical garden and I am out of control. But I have developed an eye at least for what flower pictures merit more than the usual appreciative nod. This is one. Colors are marvelous, composition outstanding and lighting.. someday I want to be able to light my photos this well. Nicely done.</td>', 'Flowers are like opium to me.. give me a camera and a botanical garden and I am out of control. But I have developed an eye at least for what flower pictures merit more than the usual appreciative nod. This is one. Colors are marvelous, composition outstanding and lighting.. someday I want to be able to light my photos this well. Nicely done.', '2005-01-29 20:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
