(1139479, 140631, 26756, '<td valign="top">Back to comment.  I think you could have improved on this photo with better lighting, mostly just more of it.  The photo is underexposed so you''re not getting a good representation of your colors, and there is a lot of noise in the picture too.  Both of those problems could be fixed if you re-shot with more light.</td>', 'Back to comment.  I think you could have improved on this photo with better lighting, mostly just more of it.  The photo is underexposed so you''re not getting a good representation of your colors, and there is a lot of noise in the picture too.  Both of those problems could be fixed if you re-shot with more light.', '2005-01-29 21:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
