(1139633, 140859, 14476, '<td valign="top">I really like the flying formation to the right.  But the ''frosting on the cake'' is that super red hydrant.  Good one and an easy 10</td>', 'I really like the flying formation to the right.  But the ''frosting on the cake'' is that super red hydrant.  Good one and an easy 10', '2005-01-29 23:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
