(1139635, 140806, 26756, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  I like the diagonal composition, the color, and the fact that they are upside down.  The lighting is soft and warm and the water droplets add a nice touch.    The only thing I would change is the part of the background directly behind the flowers that isn''t dark.  I think all-dark would be more dramatic.  Great photo.</td>', 'Excellent photo.  I like the diagonal composition, the color, and the fact that they are upside down.  The lighting is soft and warm and the water droplets add a nice touch.    The only thing I would change is the part of the background directly behind the flowers that isn''t dark.  I think all-dark would be more dramatic.  Great photo.', '2005-01-29 23:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139636, 140654, 14476, '<td valign="top">Beautifully photographed, and they were the best looking cupcakes too!  10</td>', 'Beautifully photographed, and they were the best looking cupcakes too!  10', '2005-01-29 23:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139638, 140340, 14476, '<td valign="top">Original and beautifully photographed.</td>', 'Original and beautifully photographed.', '2005-01-29 23:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139640, 140898, 26756, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The framing is great...nice use of negative space.  You used the shape of the blades very well.  The soft, muted yellow background is attractive too.  Nice photo.</td>', 'I like this.  The framing is great...nice use of negative space.  You used the shape of the blades very well.  The soft, muted yellow background is attractive too.  Nice photo.', '2005-01-29 23:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139644, 140844, 26756, '<td valign="top">I love this.  Unusual, artistic and well thought out angle for the shot.  There is a lot of detail, patterns and textures happening, and a very attractive woman which never hurts.  Most likely you''re going to be killed in the voting due to interpretation issues, but not by me.</td>', 'I love this.  Unusual, artistic and well thought out angle for the shot.  There is a lot of detail, patterns and textures happening, and a very attractive woman which never hurts.  Most likely you''re going to be killed in the voting due to interpretation issues, but not by me.', '2005-01-29 23:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139647, 140799, 26756, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective shot, with nice blending of grays, blacks and silvers.  Nice use of dof and a good macro.  Focus is crisp where it needs to be.</td>', 'Simple and effective shot, with nice blending of grays, blacks and silvers.  Nice use of dof and a good macro.  Focus is crisp where it needs to be.', '2005-01-29 23:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139705, 140586, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot is very yellow.  This leads me to belive that your white balance is wrong.  Did you shoot this under regular lighting (incandescent light bulbs)?  If so, you need to adjust your cameras settings to reflect this.  Your gold tone border might work with the shot IF the white balance was correct.  In this example though, your border accentuates the yellowness of the shot and contributes to the issue.  Compositionally the shot is not bad, but the subject material isn''t such to hold interest for long...<br/>TC</td>', 'This shot is very yellow.  This leads me to belive that your white balance is wrong.  Did you shoot this under regular lighting (incandescent light bulbs)?  If so, you need to adjust your cameras settings to reflect this.  Your gold tone border might work with the shot IF the white balance was correct.  In this example though, your border accentuates the yellowness of the shot and contributes to the issue.  Compositionally the shot is not bad, but the subject material isn''t such to hold interest for long...TC', '2005-01-30 01:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139708, 140321, 9906, '<td valign="top">Not a bad composition.  Just needs a tad bit more light.  I know it seems counter intuititive, but if you were to try a reshoot with some more ambient lighting, this could go from an average shot to a good one.  Consider turning this into a study session and post some results if you do.  I would like to see them!<br/>TC</td>', 'Not a bad composition.  Just needs a tad bit more light.  I know it seems counter intuititive, but if you were to try a reshoot with some more ambient lighting, this could go from an average shot to a good one.  Consider turning this into a study session and post some results if you do.  I would like to see them!TC', '2005-01-30 01:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139710, 140840, 9906, '<td valign="top">I would like to know how this was lit.  At first I thought car lights, but it looks like one light source...<br/>TC</td>', 'I would like to know how this was lit.  At first I thought car lights, but it looks like one light source...TC', '2005-01-30 01:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139712, 140810, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  It seems a little unballanced though.  Some negative space at the bottom (not as much as you have at the top) would help to even it out.<br/>TC</td>', 'Great idea!  It seems a little unballanced though.  Some negative space at the bottom (not as much as you have at the top) would help to even it out.TC', '2005-01-30 01:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139713, 140549, 9906, '<td valign="top">Too much negative space...<br/>TC</td>', 'Too much negative space...TC', '2005-01-30 01:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
