(1139774, 140484, 26679, '<td valign="top">Great colouring and composition. Just a little to much grain in the sky for my liking, but this can easily be fixed with neat images.</td>', 'Great colouring and composition. Just a little to much grain in the sky for my liking, but this can easily be fixed with neat images.', '2005-01-30 02:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139779, 140543, 26679, '<td valign="top">The composition is very strong, and I like the theme of the picture. For me I would have prefered a slightly deeper DOF to get all thre in focus.</td>', 'The composition is very strong, and I like the theme of the picture. For me I would have prefered a slightly deeper DOF to get all thre in focus.', '2005-01-30 02:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139787, 140802, 30712, '<td valign="top">So simple but such impact.</td>', 'So simple but such impact.', '2005-01-30 03:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139790, 140449, 30712, '<td valign="top">Superb!<br/></td>', 'Superb!', '2005-01-30 03:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139796, 140209, 26679, '<td valign="top">Great colour and composition. I realy like feel and strenth of thi photograph.  am just a little concerened that there are 4  trees..</td>', 'Great colour and composition. I realy like feel and strenth of thi photograph.  am just a little concerened that there are 4  trees..', '2005-01-30 03:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139798, 140623, 26679, '<td valign="top">The poles dissapearing in the distance is good, however the compositional balance would be greatly enhanced if there were either :-<br/>- something wasplaced between the right hand pole and the edge of the photo, or <br/>- more of the picure was cropped off the right hand side.<br/> <br/></td>', 'The poles dissapearing in the distance is good, however the compositional balance would be greatly enhanced if there were either :-- something wasplaced between the right hand pole and the edge of the photo, or - more of the picure was cropped off the right hand side. ', '2005-01-30 03:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139799, 140273, 26679, '<td valign="top">I would prefer the background to be less dominant, allowing for more sharpness and clarity on the 3.333..</td>', 'I would prefer the background to be less dominant, allowing for more sharpness and clarity on the 3.333..', '2005-01-30 03:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139800, 140491, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - and the three pier posts top it off. I''d like to see a tad more focus or sharpness, but have no right suggesting something that I myself have trouble with :-)<br/>Anyway, nice shot- 6</td>', 'Nice composition - and the three pier posts top it off. I''d like to see a tad more focus or sharpness, but have no right suggesting something that I myself have trouble with :-)Anyway, nice shot- 6', '2005-01-30 03:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139801, 140877, 26679, '<td valign="top">great idea. I thought of the title, but not how to execute it</td>', 'great idea. I thought of the title, but not how to execute it', '2005-01-30 03:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139803, 140541, 26679, '<td valign="top">this does look 3zing. Great capture.</td>', 'this does look 3zing. Great capture.', '2005-01-30 03:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139805, 140859, 26679, '<td valign="top">Clasic compositional piece, the red hydrant works well here. Its a shame that the birds are not a little sharper</td>', 'Clasic compositional piece, the red hydrant works well here. Its a shame that the birds are not a little sharper', '2005-01-30 03:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139809, 140782, 31133, '<td valign="top">This may sound odd, but the only thing that detracts from this image for me is that the lips  dominate the photo more than the candles. Maybe if the woman were slightly more in the background or even just a bit lower in the frame (the candles could probably have even stood alone here). The use of black space, the focus, and the colors are all excellent.</td>', 'This may sound odd, but the only thing that detracts from this image for me is that the lips  dominate the photo more than the candles. Maybe if the woman were slightly more in the background or even just a bit lower in the frame (the candles could probably have even stood alone here). The use of black space, the focus, and the colors are all excellent.', '2005-01-30 03:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139811, 140878, 31133, '<td valign="top">I like the movement of the gold party thingie up in the left corner. The candles could be a wee bit sharper. The shot is nicely arranged.</td>', 'I like the movement of the gold party thingie up in the left corner. The candles could be a wee bit sharper. The shot is nicely arranged.', '2005-01-30 03:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139812, 140282, 26141, '<td valign="top">WoW =)</td>', 'WoW =)', '2005-01-30 03:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139813, 140073, 31133, '<td valign="top">Good colors (although could stand a bit more saturation) and fantastic texture in this. 6</td>', 'Good colors (although could stand a bit more saturation) and fantastic texture in this. 6', '2005-01-30 03:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139817, 140527, 26679, '<td valign="top">The bokeh is good here, however even with this as part of the compostion, I feel the image is still slightly unballanced.</td>', 'The bokeh is good here, however even with this as part of the compostion, I feel the image is still slightly unballanced.', '2005-01-30 03:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139818, 140443, 26679, '<td valign="top">Well thought out, and executed. Good capture.</td>', 'Well thought out, and executed. Good capture.', '2005-01-30 03:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139845, 140799, 26679, '<td valign="top">Good idea and a suitable composition.<br/>Unfortunatly the rather shallow DOF looses the impact</td>', 'Good idea and a suitable composition.Unfortunatly the rather shallow DOF looses the impact', '2005-01-30 05:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139862, 140353, 26679, '<td valign="top">Great Idea, and lovely colouring.</td>', 'Great Idea, and lovely colouring.', '2005-01-30 06:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139864, 140284, 26679, '<td valign="top">I love this composition, the solidity and strength of the background, with three silhouettes, with arms tucked by their sides creating androgynous forms.</td>', 'I love this composition, the solidity and strength of the background, with three silhouettes, with arms tucked by their sides creating androgynous forms.', '2005-01-30 06:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139867, 140448, 26679, '<td valign="top">Interesting selective desaturation which focuses the eye on the main subject well. <br/>However my attention is detracting by the shadow which is cast across the whole image.<br/></td>', 'Interesting selective desaturation which focuses the eye on the main subject well. However my attention is detracting by the shadow which is cast across the whole image.', '2005-01-30 06:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139885, 140353, 20066, '<td valign="top">Very creative but I''m not sure about other things.</td>', 'Very creative but I''m not sure about other things.', '2005-01-30 07:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139968, 140659, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the idea a lot. Your composition is good, but I would have preferred if the left most finger wasn''t in frame as it seem to be just hanging there out of context.</td>', 'I like the idea a lot. Your composition is good, but I would have preferred if the left most finger wasn''t in frame as it seem to be just hanging there out of context.', '2005-01-30 09:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139973, 140354, 8624, '<td valign="top">I don''t think breaking up this image horizontally with the white lines wrks very well here. The vertical treeline gets completely chopped up and it calls attention to the railroad track or road in the center of the frame that is not horizontal at all (not that it has to be, but you accentuate it in a negative way with the dividing lines) Looks to me that you had a framing effect that you wanted to try and picked the wrong image to use it.</td>', 'I don''t think breaking up this image horizontally with the white lines wrks very well here. The vertical treeline gets completely chopped up and it calls attention to the railroad track or road in the center of the frame that is not horizontal at all (not that it has to be, but you accentuate it in a negative way with the dividing lines) Looks to me that you had a framing effect that you wanted to try and picked the wrong image to use it.', '2005-01-30 10:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1139976, 140478, 8624, '<td valign="top">This had great potential - an interesting point of view, an abstract nature to the subject matter and interesting lighting. Focus seems a bit soft and tones are a bit flat though.</td>', 'This had great potential - an interesting point of view, an abstract nature to the subject matter and interesting lighting. Focus seems a bit soft and tones are a bit flat though.', '2005-01-30 10:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140018, 140341, 5475, '<td valign="top">Aaahhhrrrggg... I''ve got pepper in my eyes!!!</td>', 'Aaahhhrrrggg... I''ve got pepper in my eyes!!!', '2005-01-30 11:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140021, 140815, 5475, '<td valign="top">I didn''t have time to enter this challenge, but I''m happy to see someone did an image with this in mind. It is also very well executed!  It is difficult to light by candle, and you have done so perfectly.  10 from me!</td>', 'I didn''t have time to enter this challenge, but I''m happy to see someone did an image with this in mind. It is also very well executed!  It is difficult to light by candle, and you have done so perfectly.  10 from me!', '2005-01-30 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140025, 140334, 5475, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the glasses, and the play of the colors is great, worthy of a 10.  The lighting on the background, with wrinkles, kind of kills the impact a little.  This would be an easy 10 with a crisp, white background.  Still a high score, though!  Great work.</td>', 'The lighting on the glasses, and the play of the colors is great, worthy of a 10.  The lighting on the background, with wrinkles, kind of kills the impact a little.  This would be an easy 10 with a crisp, white background.  Still a high score, though!  Great work.', '2005-01-30 11:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140031, 140663, 5475, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen some nice images in this challenge, and I''ve given some good scoes.  Still, I was waiting for the one that makes me say WOW! and this is it.  Great composition, detail is there, colors are great, DOF to throw the background out of focus.  Perfect 10 from me!  From what I''ve seen so far, I expect this to ribbon.  Good Luck,<br/>JD</td>', 'I''ve seen some nice images in this challenge, and I''ve given some good scoes.  Still, I was waiting for the one that makes me say WOW! and this is it.  Great composition, detail is there, colors are great, DOF to throw the background out of focus.  Perfect 10 from me!  From what I''ve seen so far, I expect this to ribbon.  Good Luck,JD', '2005-01-30 11:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140045, 140824, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice orientation, lighting, and color.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice orientation, lighting, and color.  Good job.', '2005-01-30 11:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140046, 140630, 6600, '<td valign="top">Clean, cool, relaxing shot.  Great job!</td>', 'Clean, cool, relaxing shot.  Great job!', '2005-01-30 11:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140048, 140630, 10858, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity here. Though, I feel you loose some tones and details on the ground. If it''s because of the homogenic snow, I would crop a bit to avoid or minimalize detailless areas. Just an idea, anyway, I love the mood and the composition.</td>', 'I love the simplicity here. Though, I feel you loose some tones and details on the ground. If it''s because of the homogenic snow, I would crop a bit to avoid or minimalize detailless areas. Just an idea, anyway, I love the mood and the composition.', '2005-01-30 11:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140050, 140654, 10858, '<td valign="top">Lovely sharp photo with clear colours! I love the tilting composition and the DOF you used, and the shades of the flames. Good luck!</td>', 'Lovely sharp photo with clear colours! I love the tilting composition and the DOF you used, and the shades of the flames. Good luck!', '2005-01-30 11:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140053, 140356, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice and soft, unique colors.  ''Mauve-lous'' might have been a good title.</td>', 'Nice and soft, unique colors.  ''Mauve-lous'' might have been a good title.', '2005-01-30 11:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140054, 140679, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice nostalgic mood. I love the sepia tones and the colours of the dolls'' eyes. great models indeed, soft beauty in this world we live now.</td>', 'Nice nostalgic mood. I love the sepia tones and the colours of the dolls'' eyes. great models indeed, soft beauty in this world we live now.', '2005-01-30 11:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140060, 140677, 10858, '<td valign="top">Expressing use of negative space, the comparative colours work well. Though, you loose some details and shades of the petals. A bit of underexposing would have helped, I think so.</td>', 'Expressing use of negative space, the comparative colours work well. Though, you loose some details and shades of the petals. A bit of underexposing would have helped, I think so.', '2005-01-30 11:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140064, 140296, 10858, '<td valign="top">Classical composition and DOF, the colours work well, too. I like these russian dolls, too, good luck. :-)</td>', 'Classical composition and DOF, the colours work well, too. I like these russian dolls, too, good luck. :-)', '2005-01-30 11:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140065, 140790, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the shades of blue very much! The clearness of the glasses came out well without overexposing. Clear, sharp, simple and there is something in it, a perfect candidate for a ribbon. :-) Good luck!</td>', 'I like the lighting and the shades of blue very much! The clearness of the glasses came out well without overexposing. Clear, sharp, simple and there is something in it, a perfect candidate for a ribbon. :-) Good luck!', '2005-01-30 11:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140068, 140811, 10858, '<td valign="top">Simple but clear tones, shapes and composition. I especially like the lighting here. One of my favourites in this race, good luck!! :-)</td>', 'Simple but clear tones, shapes and composition. I especially like the lighting here. One of my favourites in this race, good luck!! :-)', '2005-01-30 11:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140072, 140806, 10858, '<td valign="top">Amazing colours! Composition and lighting is spot on, too! :-) I wish there was a bit more space on the bottom, but still one of my favourites in this challenge. :-)</td>', 'Amazing colours! Composition and lighting is spot on, too! :-) I wish there was a bit more space on the bottom, but still one of my favourites in this challenge. :-)', '2005-01-30 11:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
