(1140298, 140354, 18194, '<td valign="top">I don''t see that the lines add anything to this photo.  It also looks like you sharpened the photo after you put in the lines, IMO it would have looked better to put the lines in at the end, after all other processing.</td>', 'I don''t see that the lines add anything to this photo.  It also looks like you sharpened the photo after you put in the lines, IMO it would have looked better to put the lines in at the end, after all other processing.', '2005-01-30 15:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
