(1148313, 140811, 25571, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and displace of the items. A bit dull in colours (of lack there of) even as a desaturated picture. Perharps a little more contrast and a dark frame wouldve given the pic more depth and drama. 7.</td>', 'Nice composition and displace of the items. A bit dull in colours (of lack there of) even as a desaturated picture. Perharps a little more contrast and a dark frame wouldve given the pic more depth and drama. 7.', '2005-02-03 04:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
