(1149320, 140659, 29269, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred to have a different, more standard aspect ratio for this photo. But even this way, the composition is perfect, with my eyes going from lower left to the upper right and back, constantly exploring the image. I just love this one, my pick for a ribbon.</td>', 'I would have preferred to have a different, more standard aspect ratio for this photo. But even this way, the composition is perfect, with my eyes going from lower left to the upper right and back, constantly exploring the image. I just love this one, my pick for a ribbon.', '2005-02-03 16:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
