(1149722, 140543, 18349, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering if this is faidoi''s shot... it reminds me of his stock images.  Good idea, good shot, good lighting.  Maybe a bit more focus on the front coin.  :o)</td>', 'I''m wondering if this is faidoi''s shot... it reminds me of his stock images.  Good idea, good shot, good lighting.  Maybe a bit more focus on the front coin.  :o)', '2005-02-03 21:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1149726, 140334, 18349, '<td valign="top">The glasses are beautifully lit and very sharp and colorful.  But the close, wrinkled background and the 3 and the ++ really detract.  A plain white posterboard or piece of foamcore and no other elements would have made this good effort great, IMHO.  :o)</td>', 'The glasses are beautifully lit and very sharp and colorful.  But the close, wrinkled background and the 3 and the ++ really detract.  A plain white posterboard or piece of foamcore and no other elements would have made this good effort great, IMHO.  :o)', '2005-02-03 21:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
