(1149924, 140811, 22011, '<td valign="top">Woo-hoo. :-).<br/> <br/>Thanks for the votes&amp;comments.<br/> <br/>Just goes to show, it''s not the camera....  This was the first time I used this camera, and it''s a P&amp;S.  Got me my highest placing yet..<br/> <br/>Cheers, Me.</td>', 'Woo-hoo. :-). Thanks for the votes&comments. Just goes to show, it''s not the camera....  This was the first time I used this camera, and it''s a P&S.  Got me my highest placing yet.. Cheers, Me.', '2005-02-04 00:16:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1149926, 140806, 20779, '<td valign="top">Wow are you going strong!!!  Congrats!   Edit for typo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-04 00:21:45.</i></td>', 'Wow are you going strong!!!  Congrats!   Edit for typo.', '2005-02-04 00:18:11.000000', '2005-02-04 00:21:45.000000', 0),
(1149927, 140321, 21202, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=142753" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/21202/thumb/142753.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/21202/thumb/142753.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/21202/thumb/142753.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I had my monitor misadjusted when I submitted my entry and it was far too dark.  Nevertheless, the original shot was kind of bad.  There was glare reflected off the mirror on to my camera lens and the black shirt that I used as a backdrop was not at all black in the picture itself.  So, all in all, even though I like the composition and colors, this photo received far higher votes than I believe it deserved.</td>', '  I had my monitor misadjusted when I submitted my entry and it was far too dark.  Nevertheless, the original shot was kind of bad.  There was glare reflected off the mirror on to my camera lens and the black shirt that I used as a backdrop was not at all black in the picture itself.  So, all in all, even though I like the composition and colors, this photo received far higher votes than I believe it deserved.', '2005-02-04 00:18:26.000000', NULL, 0),
