(1150223, 140785, 18349, '<td valign="top">Wow...I''m stunned that a dreaded kid shot did so well!  Yep, these are my boys...I had them to lie down on the living room floor for this one (they were so THRILLED about it too) and took about 3 shots, and this was the last one.  I thought it was a  bit "artsy" and different, and figured it might be a 5.1.  I''m glad I was wrong!  :o)</td>', 'Wow...I''m stunned that a dreaded kid shot did so well!  Yep, these are my boys...I had them to lie down on the living room floor for this one (they were so THRILLED about it too) and took about 3 shots, and this was the last one.  I thought it was a  bit "artsy" and different, and figured it might be a 5.1.  I''m glad I was wrong!  :o)', '2005-02-04 06:36:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1150233, 140785, 18191, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by laurielblack:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow...I''m stunned that a dreaded kid shot did so well!  Yep, these are my boys...I had them to lie down on the living room floor for this one (they were so THRILLED about it too) and took about 3 shots, and this was the last one.  I thought it was a  bit "artsy" and different, and figured it might be a 5.1.  I''m glad I was wrong!  :o) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>A great photographer <i>and</i> modest!... now THAT takes skill! ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by laurielblack: Wow...I''m stunned that a dreaded kid shot did so well!  Yep, these are my boys...I had them to lie down on the living room floor for this one (they were so THRILLED about it too) and took about 3 shots, and this was the last one.  I thought it was a  bit "artsy" and different, and figured it might be a 5.1.  I''m glad I was wrong!  :o)  A great photographer and modest!... now THAT takes skill! ;-)', '2005-02-04 06:52:08.000000', NULL, 0),
