(1150250, 140607, 29148, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. One technical correction. What you are seeing is not steam, which is invisible. You are seeing steam that condensed as minute water droplets. Good thing it did or your shot would not be as great as it was. Congratulations!</td>', 'Beautiful shot. One technical correction. What you are seeing is not steam, which is invisible. You are seeing steam that condensed as minute water droplets. Good thing it did or your shot would not be as great as it was. Congratulations!', '2005-02-04 07:28:17.000000', NULL, 0),
