(1150924, 140844, 6349, '<td valign="top">What the hell happened here.  This was hands down the best photo in the challenge and it met the challenge perfectly because there are 3 people in the photo.  The title is great but I bet your score would have been at least one whole point higher if you had called it "3 Friends at 3 am" or something like that.  This is my new favorite photo on dpc.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-07 19:27:18.</i></td>', 'What the hell happened here.  This was hands down the best photo in the challenge and it met the challenge perfectly because there are 3 people in the photo.  The title is great but I bet your score would have been at least one whole point higher if you had called it "3 Friends at 3 am" or something like that.  This is my new favorite photo on dpc.', '2005-02-04 16:51:58.000000', '2005-02-07 19:27:18.000000', 0),
(1150927, 140282, 6349, '<td valign="top">I recognized the poem right away and got the reference.  Terrific I say, just splendid.  Barbed wire is fantastic and so is trespassing.  Weird to see you take photos without people.  :)</td>', 'I recognized the poem right away and got the reference.  Terrific I say, just splendid.  Barbed wire is fantastic and so is trespassing.  Weird to see you take photos without people.  :)', '2005-02-04 16:54:12.000000', NULL, 0),
