(1151011, 140884, 22734, '<td valign="top">Hey Robert: You are the perfect example of success. You steadfastly stayed on course perfecting your craft and inching higher and higher. Ah, yes, you succeeded long ago but today comes the recognition with a brilliant Blue and so well earned ribbon. I am very pleased with your adventure and welcome to the club, many more will await you. This tulip image is a real beauty.</td>', 'Hey Robert: You are the perfect example of success. You steadfastly stayed on course perfecting your craft and inching higher and higher. Ah, yes, you succeeded long ago but today comes the recognition with a brilliant Blue and so well earned ribbon. I am very pleased with your adventure and welcome to the club, many more will await you. This tulip image is a real beauty.', '2005-02-04 18:00:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1151015, 140607, 22734, '<td valign="top">Ron you are too cool! Congratulations on your red. I did not comment bit I did vote high this impressive 3 image. Way to go and keep the cool images coming.</td>', 'Ron you are too cool! Congratulations on your red. I did not comment bit I did vote high this impressive 3 image. Way to go and keep the cool images coming.', '2005-02-04 18:02:39.000000', NULL, 0),
