(1151131, 140755, 28261, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hsteg:</b></div><hr/><i> The importance of commas.<br/> <br/>As posted:<br/>Well, hung in the lundry room, lucky me no one came while shooting. <br/> <br/>No commas:<br/><b>Well hung</b> in the lundry room lucky me no one came while shooting. <br/> <br/>Sorry, Im not funny. lol </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think yur funny as ...oh, hell0.  I was thinking the same thing.  <br/> <br/>IMAGE:  Good (not great) photography, bad subject.  What this means is, the technical photography is great the image itself is not.<br/> <br/>Sure to get people worked up and ''punishing'' you for going out on a limb.  Could have been better spaced to fill the area or a slightly different angle to bring some art to it, but overall this is a quality job of capturing an image. Don''t let the negative reaction of a slew of one''s get you on this.  You struck a chord and people noticed.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-04 19:42:31.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by hsteg: The importance of commas. As posted:Well, hung in the lundry room, lucky me no one came while shooting.  No commas:Well hung in the lundry room lucky me no one came while shooting.  Sorry, Im not funny. lol   I think yur funny as ...oh, hell0.  I was thinking the same thing.   IMAGE:  Good (not great) photography, bad subject.  What this means is, the technical photography is great the image itself is not. Sure to get people worked up and ''punishing'' you for going out on a limb.  Could have been better spaced to fill the area or a slightly different angle to bring some art to it, but overall this is a quality job of capturing an image. Don''t let the negative reaction of a slew of one''s get you on this.  You struck a chord and people noticed.', '2005-02-04 19:40:58.000000', '2005-02-04 19:42:31.000000', 0);
