(1152452, 140284, 24764, '<td valign="top">I have to tell you that the atmosphere of this picture is very profound. There is so much to it really... The lonely man in motion, the scale of the statues with respect to the wall behind and the two observers with the light behind them. This is such a terrific shot with excellent composition.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-05 19:59:08.</i></td>', 'I have to tell you that the atmosphere of this picture is very profound. There is so much to it really... The lonely man in motion, the scale of the statues with respect to the wall behind and the two observers with the light behind them. This is such a terrific shot with excellent composition.', '2005-02-05 19:30:36.000000', '2005-02-05 19:59:08.000000', 0),
(1152455, 140884, 32754, '<td valign="top">Lovely, lovely, photograph..color and tranquillity and composition are tops.</td>', 'Lovely, lovely, photograph..color and tranquillity and composition are tops.', '2005-02-05 19:33:02.000000', NULL, 0),
