(1154653, 140755, 9073, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hsteg:</b></div><hr/><i> The importance of commas.<br/> <br/>As posted:<br/>Well, hung in the lundry room, lucky me no one came while shooting. <br/> <br/>No commas:<br/><b>Well hung</b> in the lundry room lucky me no one came while shooting. <br/> <br/>Sorry, Im not funny. lol </i></td></tr></table> <br/>This made me laugh. However, adding a period might help, too. (The last sentence might be read in various ways, too.)<br/> <br/><b>Well hung</b> in the laundry room, <i>lucky me</i>. No one <b>came</b> while shooting.</td>', 'Originally posted by hsteg: The importance of commas. As posted:Well, hung in the lundry room, lucky me no one came while shooting.  No commas:Well hung in the lundry room lucky me no one came while shooting.  Sorry, Im not funny. lol  This made me laugh. However, adding a period might help, too. (The last sentence might be read in various ways, too.) Well hung in the laundry room, lucky me. No one came while shooting.', '2005-02-07 08:32:11.000000', NULL, 0),
