(1167443, 140755, 31637, '<td valign="top">I originally gave this a six during the challenge. I was on the floor when I saw this, and its hilarious. But poeple vote on other things, such as composition, and things done in the shot like perspectives, focus, angles, placement of subjects etc. I gave you points for creativity, and focus. Good solid neat background. Clever thinking, it definatly should  of got at least a 5.5 to a 6.</td>', 'I originally gave this a six during the challenge. I was on the floor when I saw this, and its hilarious. But poeple vote on other things, such as composition, and things done in the shot like perspectives, focus, angles, placement of subjects etc. I gave you points for creativity, and focus. Good solid neat background. Clever thinking, it definatly should  of got at least a 5.5 to a 6.', '2005-02-14 01:26:29.000000', NULL, 0),
